Our free title Copa Petrobras de Marcas is now officially available on Steam including some fresh updates!

The new v1.10 update is also available via Marcas Sync for users running Non-Steam installations.

Main Changelog for v1.10:
Added UI option for race start time (including night racing!)
Added option to turn off qualifying and manually set starting position;
Added proper flag animations;
Support for adjusting graphical steering wheel range in-game from the Controller menu (min 180º max 900º);
Adjusted default rearview height / width;
Minimum vertical FOV setting adjusted from 35º to 10º;
Revised physics;
Revised sounds;
Revised AI;
Increased windshield resolution;
Added individual driver helmet textures
Updated Tarumã track to the latest specification

